{"4640410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pardanthropy", "steam_appid": 4640410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Pardanthropy</strong></u> (Pardos - Leopard, Anthropos - Human)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced third person shooter with brutal takedowns and lots of blood. Plan your moves carefully - your opponents can die in one hit, but so can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Items</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an arsenal of 5+ guns, each with their own unique handling (ever tried using a binary trigger?). Be on the look out for helmets to help you survive just that bit longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Third Person</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to your advantage! Switch shoulders and look around corners before peeking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640410/extras/c0aa24daba4dc04a57eac42e1d86f946.avif?t=1778628108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640410/extras_big/c0aa24daba4dc04a57eac42e1d86f946.webp?t=1778628108 width=1560 height=748 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Pardanthropy</strong></u> (Pardos - Leopard, Anthropos - Human)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced third person shooter with brutal takedowns and lots of blood. Plan your moves carefully - your opponents can die in one hit, but so can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Items</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an arsenal of 5+ guns, each with their own unique handling (ever tried using a binary trigger?). Be on the look out for helmets to help you survive just that bit longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Third Person</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to your advantage! Switch shoulders and look around corners before peeking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640410/extras/c0aa24daba4dc04a57eac42e1d86f946.avif?t=1778628108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640410/extras_big/c0aa24daba4dc04a57eac42e1d86f946.webp?t=1778628108 width=1560 height=748 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Tear through the city in brutal and unforgiving close quarters combat... as an anthropomorphic snow leopard.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640410/b56dd408f60fe2171b0e365154a3a8a11c8c6aaa/header.jpg?t=1778628108", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640410/37fd43d1baee206d7f673774ba048b9525f6e581/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778628108", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640410/37fd43d1baee206d7f673774ba048b9525f6e581/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778628108", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 420 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Danaby"], "publishers": ["Danaby"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor